From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Electron contributors <electron@github.com>
Subject: fix: isolate directed debugger input in embedded WebContents on Windows and macOS

Keep ordinary mouse, keyboard, text and composition inside the embedded
WebContents while its debugger session emulates focus. Preserve existing
input handling for all other commands and ordinary user input.

